<div class="routine-journey">
 <section class="setup">
  <header><p class="eyebrow">Parent · getting started on iPhone</p><h4>Make the board your family’s</h4></header>
  <div class="entry-options"><div><strong>Explore the Sample Family</strong><p>Optional preview before personal setup.</p></div><span aria-hidden="true">or</span><div><strong>Create a family directly</strong><p>Start your own board without trying the sample.</p></div></div>
  <p class="join-line"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span> Create your family board and add your child and routines.</p>
 </section>
 <section class="daily">
  <header><p class="eyebrow">Parent and child · repeat each day</p><h4>Do the routine, then mark it together</h4></header>
  <ol class="daily-loop">
   <li><span class="routine-number">01</span><strong>Choose the child</strong><p>Open their familiar routine board.</p></li>
   <li><span class="routine-number">02</span><strong>Complete a routine</strong><p>Brush teeth, read or finish another family activity.</p></li>
   <li><span class="routine-number">03</span><strong>Mark it done</strong><p>The completed routine adds stars to the week.</p></li>
  </ol>
  <p class="return"><span aria-hidden="true">↶</span> Return for the next routine. A missed day does not deduct earned stars.</p>
 </section>
 <div class="alongside">
  <section>
   <header><p class="eyebrow">Across the week</p><h4>Small actions build visible progress</h4></header>
   <ol class="routine-progress"><li>Completed routines</li><li>Stars accumulate</li><li>The weekly pet grows at star thresholds</li></ol>
   <p class="routine-note">A new egg arrives on Monday to start the next week.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
   <header><p class="eyebrow">Once the family board exists</p><h4>Another adult can pick up here</h4></header>
   <ol class="routine-progress"><li>Parent shares an invite link</li><li>Second adult joins the same board</li><li>Both adults see and update the family’s routines</li></ol>
   <p class="routine-note">This handoff can happen during setup or later. It does not depend on finishing a week.</p>
  </section>
 </div>
</div>
<style>
.routine-journey{display:grid;gap:24px;max-width:900px}.routine-journey section{padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--divider);border-radius:8px;background:var(--bg-2)}
header{margin-bottom:20px}.eyebrow{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--project-ink);margin:0 0 8px}h4{font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:500;margin:0}strong{font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600}p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--fg-2)}
.entry-options{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;gap:20px}.entry-options>div{border-left:2px solid var(--project-ink);padding-left:16px}.entry-options>span{font-size:14px;color:var(--fg-2)}.join-line{padding-top:16px;margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--divider)}.join-line span{color:var(--project-ink);margin-right:8px}
.daily-loop{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px}.daily-loop li{position:relative;min-width:0}.daily-loop li+li:before{content:'→';position:absolute;left:-20px;top:0;color:var(--project-ink)}.routine-number{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--project-ink);margin-bottom:10px}.return{padding-top:16px;border-top:1px dashed var(--divider);margin-top:24px}.return span{color:var(--project-ink);margin-right:8px}
.alongside{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.routine-progress{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}.routine-progress li{padding-left:20px;border-left:2px solid var(--project-ink);position:relative}.routine-progress li+li{padding-top:24px}.routine-progress li+li:before{content:'↓';position:absolute;left:20px;top:0;color:var(--project-ink)}.routine-note{margin-top:20px;font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:600px){.routine-journey section{padding:20px}.entry-options,.daily-loop,.alongside{grid-template-columns:1fr}.entry-options{gap:12px}.entry-options>span{padding-left:16px}.daily-loop{gap:28px}.daily-loop li+li:before{content:'↓';left:0;top:-25px}.daily-loop li{padding-left:24px}.routine-number{position:absolute;left:0;top:2px}}
</style>
